    {
      "id": "FJkW1PHxM7ju_VbllIejO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 194.5595238095243,
      "y": 987.9576713925312,
      "width": 984.6685180664062,
      "height": 1935,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aqV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1974714008,
      "version": 888,
      "versionNonce": 696787305,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758259515766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                                                Product\nGET - /brands (list of brands)\nGET - /products/:brandID (products list by brand)\nGET - /categories (list of categories)\nGET - /products/:categoryID (products list by category)\nGET -/sliders (list of product sliders)\nGet - /product/:productID (product Details by id)\nGET - /products/search/:keyword (product by keyword)\nGET - /products/remarks/:remark (products by remark)\nPOST - /products/filter (product by filter)\nGET - /product/review/:productID (products reviews)\n\nProduct related endpoints (example design)\n🔹 Brand\n\nGET /api/brands → সব brand এর list\n\nGET /api/brands/:brandID → নির্দিষ্ট brand এর details\n\nGET /api/brands/:brandID/products → সেই brand এর সব\nproduct\n\n🔹 Category\n\nGET /api/categories → সব category list\n\nGET /api/categories/:categoryID → নির্দিষ্ট category এর details\n\nGET /api/categories/:categoryID/products → সেই category এর\nসব product\n\n🔹 Product\n\nGET /api/products → সব product এর list (search, filter, sort,\npagination সহ)\n\nGET /api/products/:productID → নির্দিষ্ট product এর details\n\nPOST /api/products → নতুন product যোগ করা (Admin only)\n\nPUT /api/products/:productID → product update করা\n\nDELETE /api/products/:productID → product delete করা",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "d0ZGs72NgO-6FcpchShD9",
      "originalText": "                                                Product\nGET - /brands (list of brands)\nGET - /products/:brandID (products list by brand)\nGET - /categories (list of categories)\nGET - /products/:categoryID (products list by category)\nGET -/sliders (list of product sliders)\nGet - /product/:productID (product Details by id)\nGET - /products/search/:keyword (product by keyword)\nGET - /products/remarks/:remark (products by remark)\nPOST - /products/filter (product by filter)\nGET - /product/review/:productID (products reviews)\n\nProduct related endpoints (example design)\n🔹 Brand\n\nGET /api/brands → সব brand এর list\n\nGET /api/brands/:brandID → নির্দিষ্ট brand এর details\n\nGET /api/brands/:brandID/products → সেই brand এর সব product\n\n🔹 Category\n\nGET /api/categories → সব category list\n\nGET /api/categories/:categoryID → নির্দিষ্ট category এর details\n\nGET /api/categories/:categoryID/products → সেই category এর সব product\n\n🔹 Product\n\nGET /api/products → সব product এর list (search, filter, sort, pagination সহ)\n\nGET /api/products/:productID → নির্দিষ্ট product এর details\n\nPOST /api/products → নতুন product যোগ করা (Admin only)\n\nPUT /api/products/:productID → product update করা\n\nDELETE /api/products/:productID → product delete করা",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
