      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758246772221,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                                                        User\n\n- /login\n- /verify OTP\n- /logout\n\n- /user\n- /update-user\n\n- /wishlist (list whislist)\n- /add-wishlist\n- /remove-wishlist\n\n/carts\n/add-cart\n/update-cart\n/remove-cart\n\n/review/:productID\n\n✅ User related endpoints\n\nPOST /api/users/register → নতুন user signup\n\nPOST /api/users/login → login করে JWT token পাওয়া\n\nGET /api/users/profile → নিজের profile দেখা (auth required)\n\nPUT /api/users/profile → profile update\n\nGET /api/users/:userID/orders → নির্দিষ্ট user এর order history\n\n✅ Wishlist\n\nPOST /api/wishlist → product wishlist এ add করা\n\nGET /api/wishlist → user এর সব wishlist item\n\nDELETE /api/wishlist/:productID → wishlist থেকে remove করা\n\n✅ Cart\n\nPOST /api/cart → cart এ product যোগ\n\nGET /api/cart → current cart দেখা\n\nPUT /api/cart/:productID → cart quantity update\n\nDELETE /api/cart/:productID → cart থেকে product remove",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rix3187k_mR5GA3WC689U",
      "originalText": "                                                        User\n\n- /login\n- /verify OTP\n- /logout\n\n- /user\n- /update-user\n\n- /wishlist (list whislist)\n- /add-wishlist\n- /remove-wishlist\n\n/carts\n/add-cart\n/update-cart\n/remove-cart\n\n/review/:productID\n\n✅ User related endpoints\n\nPOST /api/users/register → নতুন user signup\n\nPOST /api/users/login → login করে JWT token পাওয়া\n\nGET /api/users/profile → নিজের profile দেখা (auth required)\n\nPUT /api/users/profile → profile update\n\nGET /api/users/:userID/orders → নির্দিষ্ট user এর order history\n\n✅ Wishlist\n\nPOST /api/wishlist → product wishlist এ add করা\n\nGET /api/wishlist → user এর সব wishlist item\n\nDELETE /api/wishlist/:productID → wishlist থেকে remove করা\n\n✅ Cart\n\nPOST /api/cart → cart এ product যোগ\n\nGET /api/cart → current cart দেখা\n\nPUT /api/cart/:productID → cart quantity update\n\nDELETE /api/cart/:productID → cart থেকে product remove",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
