    {
      "id": "3UEa9lFYF3i4TL73j4AFD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 190.58322434198357,
      "y": 5988.16382925851,
      "width": 1005.8573608398438,
      "height": 1980,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1671843043,
      "version": 568,
      "versionNonce": 1926874883,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758248244750,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Others\n\n/fetaures\n/legals/:type\n/payment/success/\n/payment/fail/\npayment/ipn/\npayment/cancel\n\n✅ Others Endpoints\n\n🔹 Features\n\nGET /api/features → সব feature list\n\n🔹 Legals\n\nGET /api/legals/:type → নির্দিষ্ট legal document (terms, privacy,\nrefund ইত্যাদি)\n\n🔹 Payment\n\nGET /api/payment/success → payment success callback\n\nGET /api/payment/fail → payment fail callback\n\nPOST /api/payment/ipn → payment gateway থেকে আসা\ninstant payment notification (IPN)\n\nGET /api/payment/cancel → payment cancel callback\n\n👉 Final structure দাঁড়াবে এভাবে:\n\nGET /api/features → সব feature list\n\nGET /api/legals/:type → নির্দিষ্ট legal document\n\nGET /api/payment/success → payment success callback\n\nGET /api/payment/fail → payment fail callback\n\nPOST /api/payment/ipn → payment gateway থেকে IPN receive\n\nGET /api/payment/cancel → payment cancel callback",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "T1_k5UakbB1VhhZlVb3Sn",
      "originalText": "Others\n\n/fetaures\n/legals/:type\n/payment/success/\n/payment/fail/\npayment/ipn/\npayment/cancel\n\n✅ Others Endpoints\n\n🔹 Features\n\nGET /api/features → সব feature list\n\n🔹 Legals\n\nGET /api/legals/:type → নির্দিষ্ট legal document (terms, privacy, refund ইত্যাদি)\n\n🔹 Payment\n\nGET /api/payment/success → payment success callback\n\nGET /api/payment/fail → payment fail callback\n\nPOST /api/payment/ipn → payment gateway থেকে আসা instant payment notification (IPN)\n\nGET /api/payment/cancel → payment cancel callback\n\n👉 Final structure দাঁড়াবে এভাবে:\n\nGET /api/features → সব feature list\n\nGET /api/legals/:type → নির্দিষ্ট legal document\n\nGET /api/payment/success → payment success callback\n\nGET /api/payment/fail → payment fail callback\n\nPOST /api/payment/ipn → payment gateway থেকে IPN receive\n\nGET /api/payment/cancel → payment cancel callback",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
